    "The observed logs do not provide the contents or hashes of the DOCM, downloaded script, DLL, or temporary file.",
    "The endpoint process records show a rundll32 launch but do not by themselves confirm the DLL's behavior or successful execution."
  ],
  "claims_not_established": [
    "The exact behavior or intent of the downloaded script and msupd.dll.",
    "Whether the activity achieved persistence, credential theft, privilege escalation, or access to sensitive files.",
