    "How the DOCM arrived on the workstation or whether the user intentionally opened it."
  ],
  "recommended_action": "escalate",
  "additional_evidence_needed": [
    "Isolate and preserve WS-DWELLS-01 for forensic collection; acquire the DOCM, downloaded script, msupd.dll, and temporary file with hashes and metadata.",
    "Collect endpoint protection detections and quarantine history, PowerShell script-block/AMSI logs, and relevant file-system and persistence artifacts.",
    "Review proxy inspection records or cached content for the downloaded script and investigate the source and delivery path of the DOCM.",
    "Search other hosts and identity, email, and file-access logs for the script URL, DLL name or hash, and related activity."
  ]
}
